<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-RIGHTS/BONUS/DIV.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-RIGHTS/BONUS/DIV.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>the following shares will trade ex-dividend on Friday:</p>
<p>    COMPANY		 DIV/SHARE	   ADJUSTED PRICE</p>
<p>    Yalco     50 drachmas	     1,170</p>
<p>The following stock will trade ex-rights on Friday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	   ADJUSTED PRICE   RIGHTS TERMS  ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p>    Themeliodomi	  2,478	    3-for-10	2,050</p>
<p>Trading in Themeliodomi's rights starts Friday.</p>
<p>    RIGHTS		    STARTING PRICE  VOL.LIMIT   MIN LOT</p>
<p>    Themeliodomi		  273		 8%	  10</p>
<p>The same stock trades ex-bonus on Friday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY		ADJUSTED PRICE	    BONUS TERMS</p>
<p>    Themeliodomi	     2,478		    2-for-10</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
